# No Apple TV connection: key actions fail honestly, nothing is faked.
activate act_watch_apple_tv
advance 1000
drain
ble disconnected
tap select
expect ble dev_apple_tv key_down key=SELECT -> failed adapter_unavailable
expect ble dev_apple_tv key_up key=SELECT -> failed adapter_unavailable
ble connected
tap select
expect ble dev_apple_tv key_down key=SELECT -> accepted
